<section class="howto"><div class="narrow"><div class="howto-grid"><div class="howto-copy"><h2>시작하는 <span class="green">방법</span></h2><p>Getting started with Bytrox Global is simple and quick. Just follow these easy steps to begin your trading journey and access a world of financial opportunities.</p><a class="btn btn-primary mt24" href="${ctx}/${siteLang}/account-types">Start Trading</a></div><div class="howto-visual"><article class="how-card"><b class="num">1</b><div><h3>가입</h3><p>Complete a quick sign-up by providing your basic personal details.</p></div></article><article class="how-card"><b class="num">2</b><div><h3>입금</h3><p>Deposit funds securely using any of the available payment methods in your client portal.</p></div></article><article class="how-card"><b class="num">3</b><div><h3>Start Trading</h3><p>Access over 100 trading instruments with a minimum deposit of just $100 &mdash; and start trading instantly.</p></div></article></div></div><section class="cta home-cta"><div><h2>거래를 시작할 준비가 되셨나요?</h2><p>몇 단계만으로 계좌를 개설하고 모든 자산군에 접근하세요.</p></div><a class="btn btn-light" href="${ctx}/${siteLang}/account-types">Start Trading</a></section></div></section></main>

